Continued and wrapped up this session's testing:

- Cross-account checks (A vs B): addresses, sessions, trusted devices, MFA → all `404`; `roles/beta` rejects mismatched UUID (`403`).
- Server-side L2 gate confirmed: email change, MFA changes, password/username change, picture upload, and `/2fa/backup` return `499 L2_REQUIRED` at level 1.
- Picture upload: SVG rejected; PNG stored/served as `image/png`; caller `Content-Type: text/html` is not honored (object `AccessDenied`) → no stored XSS.
- Reset flow protected by reCAPTCHA + `_ubiquiti_private_key` + `apple_devicecheck_token`; Host spoofing blocked by CloudFront.
- New low finding VULN-20261110-004: `GET /api/sso/v1/logout` clears `.ui.com` auth cookies without a CSRF token. Also corrected VULN-20261110-003 (requires L2, not a no-reauth issue).
- Confirmed CORS trusts all `*.ui.com` on both `sso.ui.com` and `cloudaccess.svc.ui.com`; still unresolved impact (no attacker-controlled `ui.com` origin found).

Updated `progress.md`, `SUMMARY.md`, `testing-inventory.json` (21 done / 10 partial / 6 blocked, 30 endpoints), session log, and findings. No high-impact finding, so `confirmed-vuln.txt` stays empty and no Discord notification was sent.

